    imageAlt: 'CEFR language levels',
  },
  {
    slug: 'why-ireland-is-one-of-the-best-places-in-the-world-to-learn-english',
    title: 'Why Ireland Is One of the Best Places in the World to Learn English',
    excerpt: 'Ireland combines high-quality English education with a culture built on conversation, storytelling, and human connection. Discover why it\'s one of the best places in the world to learn English through immersion.',
